    "sub_ename": "QUANTITATIVE METHODS",
    "describe_ch": "-\t本課程討論自變數與應變數間關係的統計方法，介紹目前應用在金融實證上的主要研究方法，並協助學生撰寫論文之研究方法、資料分析與實證研究。",
    "describe_eh": "This course trains students to use multivariate analysis, which is a statistical methodology to examine possible relationship among multiple dependent and interdependent variables.",
